en folder in his hands.\""], "confidence": 0.99, "source_name": "Daniel", "target_name": "Daniel returns with green folder", "id": "rel_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_rel_007", "movie_id": "baseline_100_page__scene_5"}, {"temp_id": "rel_015", "source_id": "ent_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_ent_001", "source_type": "Character", "relation": "kinship_with", "target_id": "ent_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_ent_004", "target_type": "Character", "scene_id": "5", "chunk_id": "doc_4_chunk_0_part_0", "evidence": ["\"Your mother did.\"", "\"mother's wishes\""], "confidence": 0.96, "source_name": "Lucia Serrano", "target_name": "Mother", "id": "rel_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_rel_015", "movie_id": "baseline_100_page__scene_5"}, {"temp_id": "rel_016", "source_id": "ent_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_ent_001", "source_type": "Character", "relation": "kinship_with", "target_id": "ent_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_ent_005", "target_type": "Character", "scene_id": "5", "chunk_id": "doc_4_chunk_0_part_0", "evidence": ["\"I knew what it would do to him.\"", "\"your brother\""], "confidence": 0.95, "source_name": "Lucia Serrano", "target_name": "Brother", "id": "rel_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_rel_016", "movie_id": "baseline_100_page__scene_5"}, {"temp_id": "rel_017", "source_id": "ent_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_ent_001", "source_type": "Character", "relation": "kinship_with", "target_id": "ent_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_ent_003", "target_type": "Character", "scene_id": "5", "chunk_id": "doc_4_chunk_0_part_0", "evidence": ["\"Rosa spoke, very quietly. 'Lucia. Mi'ja.'\""], "confidence": 0.89, "source_name": "Lucia Serrano", "target_name": "Rosa", "id": "rel_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_rel_017", "movie_id": "baseline_100_page__scene_5"}, {"temp_id": "rel_018", "source_id": "ent_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_ent_001", "source_type": "Character", "relation": "possesses", "target_id": "ent_baseline_5_doc_4_chunk_0_part_0_ent_007", "target_type": "Object", "sc